  vendorName: Commissioner Langdon
  offerText: You are hoarding unauthorized entertainment devices. Surrender the bulky
    consoles to my custody for a standard government cash bounty.
  acceptResultText: He takes your prized entertainment systems and tosses a meager
    payment on the floor. Your space is clear, but losing your only source of joy
    plunges you into deep depression.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to comply. Langdon flies into a rage, writes you a
    massive citation fee, and smashes the devices into sharp, useless plastic shards
    across your floor.
